<body>
Reports unknown variables and variables that are unavailable in a workflow prompt.
<p>Some variables need a trigger that supplies them:</p>
<ul>
  <li>The changed file variables need a <code>session-finished</code> trigger or a Git trigger.</li>
  <li>The <code>GIT_</code> variables need a Git trigger. <code>GIT_REMOTE</code> and <code>GIT_REMOTE_BRANCH</code> need a <code>git-push</code> or a <code>git-pull</code> trigger.</li>
  <li><code>GIT_COMMIT_MESSAGE</code>, <code>COMMIT</code>, and <code>REF-COMMIT</code> need a <code>git-commit</code> trigger.</li>
</ul>
<p>Example:</p>
<pre><code>---
name: Review
trigger:
  kind: manual
agent:
  name: codex
---
Review ${CHANGED_FILES}.
</code></pre>
<p>A manual trigger supplies no changed files, so <code>${CHANGED_FILES}</code> is unavailable here.</p>
</body>
